    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56431" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεκρᾱμένως</span></b> , Adv., (<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεράννυμι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.3
				</span></i>
			) <i>in a mixed manner</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸ τῶν ἀμίκτων ἐλέγχων κ. παρέχεται
					τοῖς ἐπαίνοις αὐτούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procl.
					<u>in Alc.</u>
					p.102
				</span></i>
			 C. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in painting,
				<i>with well-blended colours</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.335a
			</span></i> (fort. leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεκριμένως</span>).</div>
